      "provenance_score": 1.0,
      "content_sha256": "6fd919b5319880a059efd70a5cdf3a102d30dbc652d9befe26e251629a5293a9"
    },
    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "For both types of twins, we start with the simple linear model",
