      "content": "where the terms $ \\sigma_{E_{s}}^{2} $ (MZ) and $ \\sigma_{E_{s}}^{2} $ (DZ) refer to the residual environmental variance, i.e., environmental variance not attributable to common familial effects (Chapter 6).",
