    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "as the estimator of $ \\sigma_{z}^{2} $. Its large-sample variance estimator is identical to that of $ \\mathrm{Var}(b) $. Confidence intervals for the within- and among-pair components of variance can be obtained by using Equations 18.22 and 18.23.",
